# bash_functions.include.raw. It is now modified with the actual
# global pipeline version number by the installation scripts.
#
# 09.12.2014:
# - new function dummies which returns an array of all free dummy key
#   numbers in a FITS file.
# - I extended the function writekey so that several keys can be treated
#   in one go.
#
# 03.07.2015:
# Major bug in function writekey: The used variable 'i' was not declared
# local and hence a vraible with the same name was falsely modified
# in the scope of the calling script! - fixed!
#
# 09.07.2015:
