# 04.08.2015:
# We need to check whether we run a script on a terminal before trying
# to produce nice output via 'tput'. Not running with a terminal is
# the case in Edinburgh when submitting jobs via qsub to worker nodes.
# In this case the tput commands produce error messages.
#
# 06.08.2015:
# Bug fix for the modification from 04.08.2015: The included tput wrapper
# function was not used correctly if tput took more than 1 argument.
